        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-31T23:01:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Since she's making one attack on multiple targets, and Lightspeed Barage changes the dice on her next attack, it changes it for all targets. If it had separated and made an attack on each different target, you would only get to apply it to the first target you damage.&nbsp;</p>",
